de_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o160c-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7bb648ea3f82596e3b9b","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，魏大将（军）王昶围南郡〖22〗，荆州刺史王基攻西陵〖23〗；遣将军戴烈、陆凯往拒之；皆引还。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":78,"end":128,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o158","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-781d2f88aede8a4f2628","layer":"original","quote":"十三年夏五月〖10〗，日至〖11〗，荧惑入南斗〖12〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":265,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o160","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7bb648ea3f82596e3b9b","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，魏将文钦伪叛以诱朱异〖18〗；权遣吕据〖19〗，就异以迎钦。异等持重，钦不敢进。十一月，立子亮为太子〖20〗。遣军十万，作堂邑涂塘以淹北道〖21〗。十二月，魏大将（军）王昶围南郡〖22〗，荆州刺史王基攻西陵〖23〗；遣将军戴烈、陆凯往拒之；皆引还。﹝四﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
